This is the story of the artist behind the voice and the sister determined to ensure Bel’s music continues to live on after her death. Filmed over three years, this intimate documentary is guided by Bel’s older sister Leah, who inherited Bel’s notebooks, journals and songbooks as well as a precious hard drive containing a folder of recordings labelled ‘passable demos’, and vows to finish the album and release it to the world.

